      "en": "He commanded the steward of his house, saying, “Fill the men’s sacks with food, as much as they can carry, and put each man’s money in his sack’s mouth.",
      "ko": "요셉이 그 청지기에게 명하여 가로되 양식을 각인의 자루에 실을 수 있을만큼 채우고 각인의 돈을 그 자루에 넣고",
      "source_text_hash": "93ff798e5b891c82e23c1886edaba76fafcf7819b1b04b656f5a82b103d2ce09",
      "translation_text_hash": "be2a6084ca912358cae130728a76eb564ace97b180a0d2eda345ce67d96df153",
