      "en": "As soon as the morning was light, the men were sent away, they and their donkeys.",
      "ko": "개동시에 사람들과 그 나귀를 보내니라",
      "source_text_hash": "b14ae0c93975435e83116dc4ea6bacd11e8c4ab8fe38d44bbe2b00b6b06f07ba",
      "translation_text_hash": "d8582c1a68d8561a37bdec7cddbe2519193b12cad3f7f16cc5bb499eace4cc67",
